  "scientific_assessment": "Independent complete-source inspection establishes equality of all13 listed solute masses, water input and NTA-first NaOH/pH preparation. Differing accession, star count, quantity metadata or closure label is not a substance distinction. The joint local registry identity is justified for the shared nominal stock only. Source processing/dose, unspecified final pH adjustment, water basis and unqualified hydrates remain explicit. The new record does not identify final post-processing speciation, promote child identities or release source claims.",
