    "assessment": "The independently supplied maintained-owner search distinguishes defined NTA stocks by ligand amount, metals/counterions, Se/W/alum and preparation. Undecomposed generic trace owners lack positive evidence of this exact stock; they are not selected as winners."
  },
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "V2-B-01",
      "status": "resolved",
      "severity": "major",
      "finding": "Two earlier proposals represented the same nominal formulation under different local identifiers. The earlier per-payload reviews did not detect this cross-author duplication.",
      "resolution": "The successor selects one root-authored formulation identity after full source comparison, retaining both immutable original proposal/history/reviewer lineages. No maintained owner is merged."
    },
    {
      "id": "V2-B-02",
      "status": "resolved",
      "severity": "major",
      "finding": "Case19 includes two unrelated NBRC1020/824 occurrences under the same generic double-star label.",
      "resolution": "The new proposal includes only1308 from case19 and1356 from case133; the two excluded occurrences retain their unchanged separate NTA/KOH proposal. All four frozen occurrence IDs and raw labels survive."
    },
    {
      "id": "V2-B-03",
      "status": "resolved",
      "severity": "major",
      "finding": "Equal nominal formulation does not establish identical source processing or final chemical endpoints.",
      "resolution": "New payload and outcomes explicitly preserve1308 one-ml autoclaved receiving mixture under80/20N2/CO2 versus1356 ten-ml filter-sterile stock inN2 handling; no endpoint equivalence is asserted."
    },
    {
      "id": "V2-B-04",
      "status": "resolved",
      "severity": "major",
      "finding": "Neither printed1L water nor namedNaOH establishes a precise final volume or quantitative titrant input; finalpH7 is a condition without an explicit readjustment reagent.",
      "resolution": "Payload retains13solutes as grams,1L water as input, unquantifiedNaOH, unspecified forms, and UNKNOWN completeness for uncertain final adjustment. It adds no global raw-label alias or child chemical mapping."
    }
  ],
